    "de": [
      "Reisendenherberge, Probiertisch, wilde Bühne oder ländliches Theater."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Family catering with Mediterranean flavors. Our products are from the short and often organic circuit. We eat under the mulberry trees in summer and by the fireplace in winter. Many activities are offered throughout the year."
